cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus or code, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "Analects stance corpus and dispute graph"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: MIT
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23983960"
abstract: >-
  Seven commentaries on the Analects (five Chinese, two Japanese, all in literary
  Chinese), annotated for stance at the level of the individual gloss, with the
  code that builds a directed dispute graph from the annotations and measures how
  many readings a term carries.
